    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Automation Engineer Task (n8n)\n\nObjective:\nEvaluate your ability to design and implement an automation workflow using\nn8n.\n\nTask Description:\nCreate an n8n workflow that automates the following process:\n1. Trigger: The workflow should start when a new entry is added to\na Google Sheet (or another data source).\n2. Data Validation:\n• Check for required fields such as email, name, or transaction\nID.\n• If data is invalid, send an error notification to a Slack\nchannel or email.\n3. Approval Step:\n• Send a notification (Slack, email, or n8n approval node) to a\ndesignated person to approve or reject the entry.\n• If rejected, log the rejection and notify the submitter.\n• If approved, continue to the next step.\n4. Action:\n• Send the approved data to an external API endpoint (mock or\nreal) using an HTTP request node.\n• Log the success/failure status in another Google Sheet or\nNotion database.\n5. Notifications:\n• Send a summary message to a Slack channel (or email) with the\nresult of the workflow execution.\n\nDeliverables:\n• Exported n8n workflow JSON file.\n• Brief README describing:\n• Workflow logic and design decisions.\n• Any assumptions made.\n• How to test or run the workflow.\n\nEvaluation Criteria:\n• Logical workflow design and clarity.\n• Proper implementation of approval and error handling.\n• Efficient use of n8n nodes and integrations.\n• Clear documentation and workflow readability.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 832
      },
